- Train the key users on the Group Financial Consolidation interface
- Support the go-live of the interface during the September financial closing, (60 users, 30 entities)
- Work directly with Accounting, Financial Control and Treasury department during the financial closing
- Develop BI reports for the Group Financial Controllers""" ;
