<http://ontology.naas.ai/personnel/Mission/frank-moreau-forgr-forge-mvp-for-startups-early-stage> a personnel:Mission,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Turn startup ideas into reality with a minimum viable product for mobile." ;
    personnel:isMissionCarriedBy <http://ontology.naas.ai/abi/Person/frank-moreau> ;
    personnel:isMissionOf <http://ontology.naas.ai/personnel/EmployeeRole/frank-moreau-forgr-forge-mvp-for-startups-early-stage> ;
    personnel:isSourcedFrom <http://ontology.naas.ai/personnel/ProfileDocument/frank-moreau-linkedin> ;
    personnel:mission_content """The concept:
We can help you turn your idea into reality with a minimum viable product (MVP) for mobile.
Save time, money and limit risks with a simplified version of your product that only includes the key features!
You can therefore test it with your target audience or present it directly to investors. We are building systems that can be scaled up so that you can gain valuable knowledge and funding to further develop yourself. It's time to find out how strong your idea is.
Background:
As part of Forgr projects, I manage clients, prospects, developers and designers to lead the completion of projects in record time of 4 weeks.
The stack:
- firebase
- angular
- ionic
- aws""" ;
