<http://ontology.naas.ai/personnel/Mission/frank-moreau-indie-makers-podcaster> a personnel:Mission,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Podcasts with Makers who have transformed their ideas into a thriving business." ;
    personnel:isMissionCarriedBy <http://ontology.naas.ai/abi/Person/frank-moreau> ;
    personnel:isMissionOf <http://ontology.naas.ai/personnel/EmployeeRole/frank-moreau-indie-makers-podcaster> ;
    personnel:isSourcedFrom <http://ontology.naas.ai/personnel/ProfileDocument/frank-moreau-linkedin> ;
    personnel:mission_content """The concept:
Here you will find podcasts where I chat with Makers who have transformed their ideas into a thriving business.
Beyond their success story, we will decipher their history, their strategy, their challenges, in order to understand how they managed to become profitable.
Every week, I interview different types of Makers, novices, seasoned, always in order to understand how they got started and how they made their business sustainable.
Context:
I created the concept from scratch based on the work of indie hackers in the US. I source the guests, summarize and build the podcast site.
https://indiemakers.fr
The stack:
- Rode wireless GO II
- Riverside FM
- Anchor
- vuejs/nuxt
- firebase""" ;
    dcterms:created "2026-08-19T08:36:17.103030"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterms:creator "generate_demo_graph" .

