By dint of doing social selling articles on Linkedin, I found myself confronting the lack of data, to analyze my ROI, on my posts, not wanting to pay 40 euro per month for that I created a tool for me and made it public
The stack:
- vuejs
- firebase
- puppeteer""" ;
    dcterms:created "2026-08-19T08:36:17.121174"^^xsd:dateTime ;
