<http://ontology.naas.ai/personnel/Mission/frank-moreau-solos-podcast-host> a personnel:Mission,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "A podcast on building a successful business as a solopreneur." ;
    personnel:isMissionCarriedBy <http://ontology.naas.ai/abi/Person/frank-moreau> ;
    personnel:isMissionOf <http://ontology.naas.ai/personnel/EmployeeRole/frank-moreau-solos-podcast-host> ;
    personnel:isSourcedFrom <http://ontology.naas.ai/personnel/ProfileDocument/frank-moreau-linkedin> ;
    personnel:mission_content """The concept:
Starting a business is not easy. Starting a business alone is even harder and it can often feel lonely in the process.
With SOLOS, we remind ourselves that there are many solo creators out there and we are no longer alone.
In this podcast, I'll discover how to create a successful business as a solopreneur, share my own solo creative journey, and hopefully make some friends along the way.
One episode every week.
https://solos.ventures
Background:
I created the concept from scratch by nesting as much as possible. I source the guest, and shoot the episodes, the rest I have an editor.
The stack:
- Rode wireless GO II
- Riverside FM
- Anchor
- youtube""" ;
    dcterms:created "2026-08-19T08:36:17.100697"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterms:creator "generate_demo_graph" .

