<http://ontology.naas.ai/personnel/Mission/frank-moreau-you2you-free-lance-fullstack-telecommuting> a personnel:Mission,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "First developer from Finland — MVP in 3 days and platform migration in one week." ;
    personnel:isMissionCarriedBy <http://ontology.naas.ai/abi/Person/frank-moreau> ;
    personnel:isMissionOf <http://ontology.naas.ai/personnel/EmployeeRole/frank-moreau-you2you-free-lance-fullstack-telecommuting> ;
    personnel:isSourcedFrom <http://ontology.naas.ai/personnel/ProfileDocument/frank-moreau-linkedin> ;
    personnel:mission_content """The concept:
Rethink your customers' delivery!
- Urban storage.
Our urban storage points allow us to act on a short circuit.
- A digital customer journey.
Give your customers the opportunity to choose their delivery window.
- 100% green deliveries.
Our deliveries are made by our fleet of bicycle couriers.
- Superior quality.
Our packages are hand delivered against signature.
Context:
I joined You2you as the first developer from Finland, I arrived when the management of deliveries was done on google sheets and it was necessary to migrate on a webapp to have a better follow-up of the deliverers.
So I developed the MVP in 3 days, which allowed us to migrate the users on my platform in one week, join TheFamily and raise our first funds on loan from VC.
I then structured the platform, created an API, chose the NodeJs, AngularJs, Grunt, Bootstrap techno.
I implemented the You2You business API which is still in production.
I administer the servers
I recruit the first 5 developers to help me build more tools to manage our processes.
The stack:
- Angularjs
- Nodejs
- GULP
- SCSS,
- pm2""" ;
    dcterms:created "2026-08-19T08:36:17.131418"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterms:creator "generate_demo_graph" .

