<http://ontology.naas.ai/personnel/Mission/grace-lambert-etix-everywhere-software-developer> a personnel:Mission,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Building a web-based Building Management System for modular data centre operations." ;
    personnel:isMissionCarriedBy <http://ontology.naas.ai/abi/Person/grace-lambert> ;
    personnel:isMissionOf <http://ontology.naas.ai/personnel/EmployeeRole/grace-lambert-etix-everywhere-software-developer> ;
    personnel:isSourcedFrom <http://ontology.naas.ai/personnel/ProfileDocument/grace-lambert-linkedin> ;
    personnel:mission_content """Etix Everywhere is a company based in Luxembourg, specialised in building modular data centres, allowing businesses to scale their physical infrastructure following their growth.
I joined the web team, with the mission of building a web-based Building Management System.
The technical stack on which I was working was:
- Yii PHP framework
- AngularJS
- Redis
- Docker
- Jenkins
During the internship, I was assigned to a new project. I had to write an SQL Proxy using Go (Golang), that will take the context of each request, and replicate them in the corresponding customer's data centre. This was a very interesting and challenging project, that I particularly liked.""" ;
    dcterms:created "2026-08-19T08:36:17.005235"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterms:creator "generate_demo_graph" .

