    personnel:mission_content "ID2I is a small company, building web services for clients. This was my first internship after a year at EPITECH. During the first month, I got to sharpen my PHP skills and worked on multiple projects. Then I was in charge of the development of a whole new project for a new client. I had to do the conception, meetings with the client, the development of the project and then the delivery. The client was very satisfied with what we delivered. It was very rewarding to be given such responsibilities that quickly." ;
